{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-solo-r5--gemma31","runHash":"32dc8bd8","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-solo-r5--gemma31.0579deb9.mp3","audioBytes":235128,"durationMs":78259,"runEndMs":37794,"timeMap":[[0,0],[9830,9830],[24666,9830],[31916,17080],[32616,17080],[41691,26155],[52607,26155],[52957,26156],[53657,26156],[57852,30351],[59352,37394],[59752,37794],[78259,37794]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6046,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared cache."},{"audioMs":6396,"endMs":9480,"runMs":6396,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":9830,"endMs":14403,"runMs":9830,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":14753,"endMs":18298,"runMs":9830,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":18648,"endMs":24316,"runMs":9830,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":24666,"endMs":30009,"runMs":9830,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":32616,"endMs":36148,"runMs":17080,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 0 opens the cache."},{"audioMs":42391,"endMs":46250,"runMs":26155,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 19 steps."},{"audioMs":46600,"endMs":47773,"runMs":26155,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":48123,"endMs":52607,"runMs":26155,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":53657,"endMs":57102,"runMs":26156,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":59752,"endMs":66228,"runMs":37794,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":66578,"endMs":73233,"runMs":37794,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":73583,"endMs":74726,"runMs":37794,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":75076,"endMs":76059,"runMs":37794,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"read":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":7}}
